## Next Recommended Step

Do not move from this handoff into solver unit expansion or original AnimBP
mutation. The next safe action is a new reviewed proof for one narrow item at a
time:

- another scalar stable input default, using the same live proof and manual
  patch pattern; or
- a separate Phase 5 solver-unit task that first updates the solver boundary
  contract and proves the change on sample/temp assets only.

Until that new review exists, keep
`Docs/Analysis/controlrig_stable_authoring_phase5_contract.md` and
`Docs/Analysis/controlrig_stable_authoring_phase6_contract.md` green.
